sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Admin
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>C: Forgot password: enter email
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/security-question
  A->>D: SELECT security_question by email
  D-->>A: question
  A-->>C: question
  U->>C: Answer and new password
  C->>A: POST /api/auth/reset-password
  A->>D: SELECT answer hash by email
  A->>A: Compare normalised answer
  alt Wrong answer
    A-->>C: 400 Security answer is incorrect
  else Correct
    A->>A: Check password policy, hash it
    A->>D: UPDATE password_hash
    A-->>C: 200 Password reset
    C-->>U: Sign in with the new password
  end
